## Why This Is Asked
Understanding end-to-end streaming ingestion, privacy handling, and basic rollback in GCP.

## Key Concepts
- Pub/Sub streaming
- Dataflow DoFn masking
- BigQuery per-tenant datasets
- Data Catalog data contracts and lineage
- Quarantine path and 24h rollback

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo Dataflow DoFn: mask PII before write
class MaskPIIFn {
  process(element) {
    // element is a JSON object
    if (element.email) element.email = maskEmail(element.email);
    if (element.phone) element.phone = maskPhone(element.phone);
    return element;
  }
}
```

